    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273476</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世界の真ん中に
怪しい洞窟みたいなのが
出てきてさ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Some kind of bizarre cavern
has opened up right in the
middle of the world...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273476</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>入ろうと思ったんだけど
不思議な力で
押し返されちゃうんだよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I thought I'd look inside,
but a strange power
pushed me back out.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世界の真ん中に出てきた
あの怪しい洞窟、
どうやっても入れないんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No matter how we try, no one
seems to be able to get
inside that bizarre cavern.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ウソじゃないぞ？
あんたらも行ってみなって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No joke. Try it out yourself
if you don't believe me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273484</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うちの人、いつまで行商人なんて
続けるのかね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How long is my husband going to keep
up this traveling merchant thing of his?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273484</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>たいした儲けにもならないのに
旅がしたいがためだけに
フラフラと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He never makes much money,
but keeps going off on a whim,
saying he "just wants to travel"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273488</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>路銀だけで赤字だってこと
あの人、気付いてないんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He doesn't even account for
all the money he's losing
on his travel expenses.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273488</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当、抜けてるよ。
本当にあれでも商売人なんかね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He's such a careless fool! And
yet he wants to be a merchant.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>裏のオルソンさん夫妻が
殺害されて１年とちょっと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's been a year and change since
the Olson couple, who live
right nearby, were murdered...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273492</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いまだ犯人が誰か
わかってないみたいだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It seems they still have no
leads on the perpetrator.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273496</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>裏のオルソンさん、気の毒にね。
人がよすぎたのが
仇になったかね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a pretty sad story, the Olsons. They
were kind people. So kind, even, that
maybe that's what did them in, in the end.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273496</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>騎士団もまじめに
捜査してくれてないみたいだし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It doesn't seem like the Knights are
investigating properly, either...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273500</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>温厚篤実で評判も
悪くなかったんだよ、
オルソンさん夫妻</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They were honest and
kind, and had a good
reputation, the Olsons.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273500</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一体、誰に恨みを
買ったのかねぇ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Who in the world would have
a grudge against them...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>確かに少し人が好すぎた
感じはする、か……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It does feel like they
were too nice, though...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああいう人ほど
裏で何やってるか
わかんないよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>With people like that, you
never really know what
they're doing in private.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オルソンさんとこから
お金借りてたせいで
私たちも容疑者にされたよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We borrowed some money from
the Olsons, once, so we're actually
on the list of suspects, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273508</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんで私たちが
あんないい人を殺さなきゃ
いけないんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But come on, why would we
ever kill such great neighbors?
It just doesn't make sense.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんか見えざる力が
動いているような気が
するんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I feel like there's some
unseen power at work,
behind all of this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273512</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>誰かが真実を隠そうとしてる
何かが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Like for some reason, someone
wants to hide the truth of it all...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は見たんだよ……
オルソンさんが殺された夜
トイレの窓から……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I saw it... From the bathroom
window... The night the
Olsons were killed...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの家を出る
黒い集団……
あれは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When they left the house...
That black armor... That...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は見た……
いや……
なんでもないよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I saw it... No...
It's nothing...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273520</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今のは忘れとくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Forget everything
I just said.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273524</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は見た……
オルソンさんをこ……た犯人……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I saw it... I saw who...
...ki...d the Olsons...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273524</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれは騎士団の……
いやいや……なんでも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Knights'...
N-No... I don't...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれは失踪した
騎士団長のウ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It was the vanished
Head Knight, U...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やばいよやばいよ……
これ以上は言えないよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's too dangerous... I
can't say anything more...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>消される……
私、消されちまう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They'll get rid of me... They'll
make me vanish, just like that...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273532</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オルソンさん殺害の秘密を……
知ってるから……いや……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Because I know...the secret
of the Olsons' murder...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>騎士団が……
私を……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Knights...
will...me...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや……
なんでも、ないよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No... It's...really
nothing...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我らは誇り高き
メイルガン族の
末裔だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We are descendants of
the proud Meilgan tribe.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、この国の王は
ユークリッド族だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, the king of this
country is of the Euclid tribe.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我らメイルガン族は
人の上に人は作らぬ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We Meilgan believe in
the equality of all men.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273544</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>故に王の座は
ヤツらにくれてやる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That is why we have
left the throne to them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>かつてこの大陸にはデロイノ族、
ユークリッド族、メイルガン族の
三部族がいた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Long ago, the Deloino,
Euclid , and Meilgan tribes
all inhabited this continent.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ユークリッド族は大陸を制覇し、国を作った</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Euclid tribe conquered this
land, and created their country.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273548</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>デロイノ族は滅び、
メイルガン族も今や少数、
風前の灯火だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Deloino people were wiped
out, and what few Meilgans are
left are as a candle in the wind.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もはや部族紛争など
起こせるほどの力もなく</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We would have no power with
which to start an ethnic conflict.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今は一族が
絶えないようにするが
精一杯だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The most we can
do is try to preserve
our people.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>妻が実は私と同じ種族で
ないことを知り、
私は大変ショックだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When I learned my wife
was not truly of my tribe,
it came as quite a shock.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一体、どうすればいいのか、
私の中で結論が出ない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wondered what I should
do from here, and even now,
I still haven't found an answer.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>例え種族は違っても
私が彼女を愛していることは
変わらない事実なのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For even if we are of
different tribes, it is still
the truth that I love her.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、ああしかし……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But... Ah, however...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273560</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私はもっと事態を正面から
受け止めるべきなのだろうか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Perhaps I should more readily
accept things simply as they are.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273564</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は実はユークリッド族です。
でも、そのことを夫には
言い出せません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The truth is, I'm from the
Euclid tribe. But, I can't bring
myself to tell my husband...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273564</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>メイルガン族の後継者を残したいと
夫は切望しているので……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He's dead set on leaving behind
a Meilgan successor, after all...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>愛さえあれば、種族なんて……
人はそう言いますが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tribal identity is insignificant in
the face of love...or so people say...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それは当事者でない人の
言葉ですよね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But it's easy to say so
when it doesn't affect you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>純粋なメイルガン族は
すっかり減ってしまいました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Pureblooded Meilgans are
rare, and becoming rarer.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私の夫はそうですが
私はそうではありません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My husband is
one, but I am not.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は自分が
メイルガン族ではないことを
言いだせません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I haven't been able to
bring myself to tell him
I am not a Meilgan.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273576</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうすればいいのでしょう。
いえ、本当のことを言うのが一番だって
わかってます……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What should I do? I
know honesty is the
best approach...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は真実を夫に
打ち明けました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I confessed
everything to
my husband.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この先、一体
どうなってしまうのか……
でも、後悔はしていません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't know what will
become of us from here...
But, I don't regret it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>愛に対する最大の裏切りは
真実を隠すこと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The greatest betrayal of
love is to hide the truth.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>57</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273584</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これで胸のつかえが降りました。
どうなってももう
構わないのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've finally gotten that heavy
weight off my chest. Whatever
happens next is no matter.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>57</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
